  "description": "PostgreSQL implementations of the Lyntai storage domains (key-value, conversations, task-scoped memory with pg_trgm substring recall, scores, run traces, versioned prompts, durable jobs) plus persistent backends for the response cache, usage tracker, and semantic-memory vector store (pgvector) — Npgsql + Dapper + FluentMigrator, wired via builder.UsePostgresStorage(connectionString). Every object is lyntai_-prefixed so it can share a consumer database.",
